# 📄 Dosya Yolu: C:/Projects/TelefonRehberi/.gitignore
# 📌 Amac: Build, runtime, dependency, mobil build ve kullanici rehber verilerini Git deposu disinda tutar.
# 📌 Config - GitIgnore
# Version: 1.3.0
# Aciklama: Kaynak kodu korur; runtime, SQLite/FlatLaf bagimliliklari, DB, token, APK build ve Xcode uretilen dosyalarini ignore eder.
# Bagimli Oldugu Katman: Tool

/build/
/dist/
/runtime/*
!/runtime/README.md
/cache/*
!/cache/README.md
/logs/*
!/logs/README.md
/backup/*
!/backup/README.md
/data/*.tsv
/data/*.db
/data/*.db-shm
/data/*.db-wal
/data/sync-token.txt
/lib/*.jar
!/lib/README.md
/app/*.jar
/mobile/android/.gradle/
/mobile/android/**/build/
/mobile/ios/**/*.xcodeproj/
/mobile/ios/**/DerivedData/
*.class
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
dist-installer/
dist-linux/
/build-tests/
/build-linux/
/dist-linux/
